ly 10 hard levels to truly test your endurance and skills in navigating out of the maze. Increase the challenge by seeking all of the Cosmic Cubes in the maze.", "short_description": "Embark on a space adventure where you navigate mind-bending cosmic mazes. Collect cubes, dodge hazards, and find your way out."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/spacemazevr/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Shashawnee Hall", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/spacemazevr/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "377978390272490"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1592192974313489"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "1238225602704374"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 3, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1918298146241975"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1370913981207707"}, {"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1008075632128436"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1008075632128436"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1790096400, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1918298146241975"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "1263451726848428", "version": "1.0003"}, "id": "2175566803167840", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_binaries": {"no